<title>CANADA: Dylex main holder to sell shrs at C$8.40.</title>
<headline>Dylex main holder to sell shrs at C$8.40.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The main shareholder of retailer Dylex Ltd, composed of River Road Canada and Silverton International Fund, agreed on Friday to sell 9,974,303 shares for C$8.40 each to a syndicate headed by CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p>The other syndicate members include Midland Walwyn Capital and Nesbitt Burns. River Road and Silverton are part of Greenwich, Conn.-based Paloma Partners.</p>
<p>Dylex shares were down 0.10 to 8.20 on the Toronto Stock Exchange today after being halted earlier for news of the transaction.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
